{
 "title": "OpenStreetMap ALPR nodes later found to be errors, left out of the maps they were on",
 "corrections": [
  {
   "what": "1,181 nodes one mapper added on 18-20 Sept 2026 as licence-plate readers, mostly airport surveillance cameras: 1,040 in Chicago (749 within 4 km of O'Hare, 291 in and near the Loop) and 141 in Bismarck, North Dakota. All are non-Flock (1,150 tagged Axis).",
   "evidence": "DeFlock's data-quality reviewers deleted or retagged every one between 22 Sept and 19 Oct 2026 (changesets commented 'Delete erroneus ALPRs added by […] in Chicago' / '... in North Dakota' and 'Correcting tags after conversation with the mapper, […]. They are not ALPRs but rather general airport surveillance.'). Creator of each node checked against the OSM API on 21 Oct 2026.",
